      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Toronto’s grand holiday tradition! The trumpets shall sound and the heavenly voices of the Toronto Choral Society and our magnificent soloists will transport you to a resplendent place of peace and beauty with an inspiring concert of music to celebrate the season. For tickets to our December 7th Con"
