      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Remembrance day is an occasion to honour the sacrifices of Canadian veterans and those who serve in the armed forces. It is also a time to reflect on the cost of war and a commitment to peace. Please join us in song as we present The Larks Still Bravely Singing, A Remembrance Day Concert at Eastmins"
      }
